"""
BTC Complex · HOMELESS PREVENTION / HOUSING MATCH  (single-file IoT Button App)
================================================================================
WHAT THIS DOES (prototype / demo only)
    Wraps a housing-match engine into a single self-contained .py file with an
    interactive IoT-kiosk / emergency-assist button UI (Tkinter + CLI fallback).

    Pressing the button runs the pipeline (typically < 5 ms on local data):
      1. Admits the request (micro / credit / free — all simulated)
      2. Obfuscates identity + purges raw PII/PHI immediately
      3. Matches against a daily library of REAL housing only
         (trailers, tiny homes, jobs-with-housing, affordable units —
          explicitly excludes shelters, hotels, motels, encampments)
      4. Two-way safety screen + ranks SAFE first, then prosperity / fit
      5. Atomically holds the open slot (TTL) while the person travels
      6. Returns next-step actions + simulated peer earnings

    Limitations (important):
    - No live data feeds, no real payments, no blockchain, no real IoT.
    - Persistence is local JSON only.
    - Not a substitute for coordinated entry, case management, or verified providers.
"""
